# Defense-in-depth checksum pin for fyom-org/fork-mpv tarballs.
#
# Format (one entry per line):
#   <sha256-hex-lowercase>  <basename-of-asset>
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# The setup_runtime_libs_* scripts verify downloaded assets against entries in
# this file. If an asset is not listed here, verification is SKIPPED (with a
# console warning) — so omitting an entry is safe; adding a wrong hash fails
# the download.
#
# Populate this file AFTER the first successful fyom-org/fork-mpv tarball
# download (Phase 2.0 deferred item #2). Until then, the file is intentionally
# empty (no entries = verification skipped = bootstrap-friendly).
#
# Example:
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-linux-arm64.tar.gz
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-macos-arm64.tar.gz
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-macos-x86_64.tar.gz
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-windows-clangarm64-arm64.tar.gz
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef  libmpv-v0.41.0-r1-fyom-dev-windows-mingw64-x86_64.tar.gz


